      "name": "Hallmark Stamp (ToB Game LP A)",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "/* Hallmark · macrostructure: Narrative Workflow · theme: custom (TechPlant paper / tp-* + tb3-*) · genre: editorial\n · paper #F6F4F0 · ink #22201C · accent #15514F (brand deep teal) · accent-2 #26AFA7 (marks only, 2.46:1 — never text)\n · display Shippori Mincho 600 / body Noto Sans JP 400\n · nav: N6 newspaper masthead (knobs: issue-line=none, wordmark=26, rule=double, link-row=own row)\n · footer: Ft2 inline single line · section-head: S2 hanging · hero: direct (H1 breaks the 680 measure to 960)\n · CTA: C1 filled-rect x4 (masthead 14/700, body 17/700, #15514F on cream 8.23:1, label 8.67:1) + C3 typographic (mail line)\n · images: 6 member avatars, 80px circles with a 1px rule (the page's only images, 2.6% of a 1440x800 viewport)\n · user-requested: same system as Ryoiku LP v2 — diversification rule waived for this frame\n · note: tp-accent left untouched so Ryoiku LP v2 (x8Ss7) is not restyled; A points at tb3-accent instead\n · pre-emit critique: P4 H4 E4 S5 R4 V2  (V<3 is the waiver above) */"
