    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "WZd3x",
      "x": 15480,
      "y": -590,
      "name": "Hallmark Stamp (ToB Game LP B)",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "/* Hallmark · macrostructure: Specimen · theme: Grid · genre: editorial (Swiss neo-grotesque)\n · paper #FAFCFE · ink #0A0E12 · rule #D6D7D9\n · signal ink: BRAND TEAL, two tones of one hue — #15514F (button fills, 8.80:1 on paper) and #26AFA7 (surfaces and geometry only, 2.63:1, never text)\n · typeface: Zen Kaku Gothic New 900/700/400 — one family, JP + Latin\n · exposed 12-column hairline grid: shell 1248 / col 104 / outer margin 96, 13 rails + 13 across the plate (#0A0E12 at 10%)\n · nav: N7 brutal slab (1px ink rule, CTA = small filled button)\n · footer: Ft8 ticker (static) + a static copyright line under the lower rule\n · section-head: outside S1-S5 — S1 banned by gate 54; 1px ink rule tops the band, heading butts under it\n · CTA: C1 filled-rect x4 (#15514F, paper label, radius 0, rule arrow). Typographic links and the outlined chip retired on user instruction, so A and B now share one CTA archetype.\n · marks: period square and 3px bars in #26AFA7, chevrons and one promoted ink rail in #0A0E12\n · deviations from the theme, recorded (5):\n   1. body line-height 1.5 -> 1.8 (Japanese)\n   2. display line-height 0.9 -> 1.15 (Japanese)\n   3. label voice 12px uppercase -> 13px JP, weight+tracking+colour carry it instead of case\n   4. signal ink is one hue in two tones, not one flat value\n   5. six member photographs (user instruction). The theme asks for geometry only; they were converted into grid units — a 208px two-column module, one 80px diameter, a 1px rule on every circle. Their colour sits outside the one-ink discipline.\n · figures carry two voices on purpose: record 24px, price 32px. Kept apart so the record band does not read as Stat-Led.\n · gate 23 deviation: the plate is full-bleed, so its viewport reads ~75% accent. Theme-sanctioned exception; ~2% elsewhere.\n · pre-emit critique: P5 H5 E4 S5 R4 V5 */"
    }
  ],
